/// known-gap: interp has no `every N ticks` blocks (VM only, owner 2026-10-25)
/// Objects made by a matrix keep their class's `every` blocks.
<>Person |
    ~age: 0
    every 1 tick
        self >> age |= self >> age + 1
    end
xx

<>Person matrix
    name: "{name}", ann, bob
    age:  10,       nc,  20
end

tick()
tick()
a | ann >> age
b | bob >> age
say("ann {a}, bob {b}")
